	The Wizard has the annoying habit of teleporting away to the up
staircase to regain hit points whenever you do much damage to him. Since
the level where you first meet him is a no-teleport level, you can't easily
follow even if you do have teleportation and teleport control. Therefore,
use the Tsurugi, which has a chance of doing instant death. The shield
of reflection shouldn't make too much difference, but make sure you have
magic resistance, or the Wizard may use a "finger of death" spell on you.
A ring of conflict is also nice to have, just in case he summons some pets.

